<title>USA: Ladd Furniture Q3 net, sales edge lower.</title>
<headline>Ladd Furniture Q3 net, sales edge lower.</headline>
<dateline>HIGH POINT, N.C. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>13 Weeks Ended			Sep 28, 1996     Sep 30, 1995</p>
<p> Net sales			    $124,094,000	159,144,000</p>
<p> Net earnings			    1,802,000	  1,891,000</p>
<p> Net earnings per common share	    0.23		 0.24</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs			   7,721,165	  7,725,805</p>
<p>39 Weeks Ended		   Sep 28, 1996(a)  Sep 30, 1995(b)</p>
<p> Net sales			    $390,034,000	461,521,000</p>
<p> Net loss				(4,028,000)     (25,408,000)</p>
<p> Net loss per common share		(0.52)	     (3.29)</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs			   7,722,924	  7,718,722</p>
<p>NOTE: Ladd Furniture Inc</p>
<p>(a) 1996 nine-month results include a pretax restructuring charge of $4.0 million.</p>
<p>(b) The 1995 nine-month results include a pretax restructuring charge of $25.7 million and a non-cash charge of $10.2 million.</p>
</text>
